# =============================================================================
# Cloudflare _redirects — first match wins, evaluated top to bottom.
#
# ORDER MATTERS FOR THE RULE LIMIT: Cloudflare allows 2000 static rules but
# only 100 dynamic ones, and it counts EVERY rule that comes after the first
# dynamic rule (one with * or :placeholder) as dynamic. So this file has two
# parts: all exact (static) rules first, then all wildcard (dynamic) rules.
# Add new exact rules to part 1, never below a wildcard.
#
# Within part 2, a wildcard must not match a path that an exact rule in part 1
# is meant to handle — part 1 already wins, but keep them disjoint anyway.
# =============================================================================

